.SH LANGUAGE
The interface detects the desktop message locale using LC_ALL, LC_MESSAGES,
and LANG. LANGUAGE may supply a colon-separated preference list.
English is the default fallback; Italian, French, German and Spanish are
supported, including regional locale variants. C and POSIX select English.
Restart the application after changing the session language.
